// A chain of HALF temps.  The reference computes the whole chain at fp16
// (prec=1) in H registers; we computed it in fp32 and converted only at the
// store, which is a precision defect, not a formatting one (t_cde25bad).
half4 main(half4 a : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR
{
	half4 b = a * (half)2.0;
	half4 c = b + a;
	return c;
}
